ARTIFACTS (STANDALONE FILES)
────────────────────────────

  Built outside the live terminal as exploration tools
  and learning aids:
  
  diagnostic.html
    Phase 1 historical strategy diagnostic.
    Walk-forward replay engine, multi-dimensional
    slicing, auto-generated insights and verdict.
    Loads from sheet directly or via CSV upload.
    
  playbook_tube_concentricity_v5.html
    3D visualization of state-space habitat tubes,
    family relationships, concentricity zones, and
    interactive guided tour. Click any element for
    explanation.
    
  vitals_splash_mockup.html
    Pre-terminal popup with three gauges (market
    regime, lens clarity, concentricity) showing
    most vital reads at a glance. Acknowledge to
    enter terminal. Bench button auto-logs.


